{"id":29651,"slug":"a-tale-of-autumn","title":"A Tale of Autumn","year":1998,"country":"France","duration":111,"spine":null,"url":"https://www.criterion.com/films/29651-a-tale-of-autumn","cover":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/criterion-production/films/e10fec5823f94ac33ba5b987434ca555/F5UzbdJJ9GAg1cD76qH5f8GQhjt10n_large.jpg","description":"The last entry in the Tales of the Four Seasons tetralogy is a breezy take on the classic American romantic comedies that influenced Eric Rohmer and his French New Wave peers. Set among the golden vineyards of the Rhône Valley, A Tale of Autumn concerns simultaneous schemes to find a new love for the reserved widow and winegrower Magali (Béatrice Romand). Her son’s girlfriend (Alexia Portal) attempts to pair her with a former professor and lover (Didier Sandre), while Magali’s friend Isabelle (Marie Rivière) assumes a false identity in order to lure eligible bachelor Gérald (Alain Libolt). The misunderstandings that follow are pure Rohmer in bringing out the humor in human folly.","boxset":0,"scraped":1,"directors":[{"name":"Eric Rohmer","slug":"eric-rohmer"}],"cast":[{"actor":"Marie Rivière","role":"Isabelle","slug":"marie-riviere"},{"actor":"Béatrice Romand","role":"Magali","slug":"beatrice-romand"},{"actor":"Alain Libolt","role":"Gérald","slug":"alain-libolt"},{"actor":"Didier Sandre","role":"Étienne","slug":"didier-sandre"},{"actor":"Alexia Portal","role":"Rosine","slug":"alexia-portal"},{"actor":"Stéphane Darmon","role":"Léo","slug":"stephane-darmon"},{"actor":"Aurélia Alcaïs","role":"Émilia","slug":"aurelia-alcais"}],"credits":[{"role":"Director","person":"Eric Rohmer","slug":"eric-rohmer"},{"role":"Written by","person":"Eric Rohmer","slug":"eric-rohmer"},{"role":"Producer","person":"Margaret Ménégoz","slug":null},{"role":"Producer","person":"Les Films du Losange","slug":null},{"role":"Producer","person":"La Sept Cinéma","slug":null},{"role":"Production manager","person":"Françoise Etchegaray","slug":null},{"role":"Cinematograph